This product includes code adapted from codex-rs/windows-sandbox-rs
(https://github.com/openai/codex, commit e01f38c3, September 2026).

Original license: Apache License, Version 2.0
Original copyright: OpenAI

The vendored files are located in:
  plugins/local-tools/sandbox/src/vendor/

The adapted code provides OS-level process sandboxing for Windows:
- Restricted token creation (token.rs, adapted from codex-rs token.rs)
- Filesystem ACL management (acl.rs, adapted from codex-rs acl.rs)
- Capability SID creation and storage (cap.rs, adapted from codex-rs cap.rs)
- Process spawning under restricted identity (process.rs, spawn_prep.rs)
- Network-blocking environment variables (env.rs)
- Elevated sandbox user accounts and WFP network filters (identity.rs, wfp.rs)

Type replacements relative to the original:
- codex_protocol::models::PermissionProfile → HbarPermissionProfile (this crate)
- codex_utils_absolute_path::AbsolutePathBuf → std::path::PathBuf
- codex_utils_pty::JobObject → crate::vendor::job_object::JobObject
- codex_utils_pty::SpawnedProcess → crate::SandboxedProcess
- codex_otel::* → removed (no telemetry in hbar)

